# Immortals punishing: nochannels, noemote, noshout, notell, freeze, log, pardon, protect, snoop, guild, the locks,
# disconnect and deny. In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60), Seraph (56), Cherub (52), Decimus (10) and
# Outlaw (18, a KILLER and a THIEF). Each no- command toggles, refuses those of the same trust or above, and shows on
# wiznet's penalties; nochannel's and notell's "whom?" have no newline (#71). Snoop shows what the victim types
# and sees, refuses a snoop-proof victim, one already snooped and a loop (made with trust), and "snoop self" ends
# them all. guild into a clan that isn't independent doesn't tell the victim (#71). Last, a denied player is quit
# and can't come back, and wizlock and newlock turn away a mortal and a new name.
